  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {麗|うるわ}しい{友情|ゆうじょう} (beautiful friendship)\n- {麗|うるわ}しい{姿|すがた} (lovely figure)\n- {麗|うるわ}しい{関係|かんけい} (beautiful relationship)\nA literary, elevated word for beauty. Implies refined elegance and grace rather than mere physical attractiveness. Often used in formal or poetic contexts.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {美|うつく}しい - general beauty (more common)\n- {麗|うるわ}しい - refined, graceful beauty (more literary)\n- {綺麗|きれい} - pretty, clean (casual)\n\nFORMS:\n- Adverb: {麗|うるわ}しく",
